NNOOTTEESS
     rroouuttee66dd uses the advanced IPv6 API, defined in RFC 3542, for communicat‐
     ing with peers using link-local addresses.

     Routing table manipulation differs from IPv6 implementation to implemen‐
     tation.  Currently rroouuttee66dd obeys the WIDE Hydrangea/KAME IPv6 kernel, and
     will not be able to run on other platforms.

     Currently, rroouuttee66dd does not reduce the rate of the triggered updates when
     consecutive updates arrive.

